## Previously raised findings (review-round registry)

These defects were raised on earlier review rounds of this PR. For each finding below: verify fixed (cite the fixing hunk), withdraw (reason required), or mark re-introduced. New claims need new evidence — a claim already on this list is answered, not re-raised.

| id | status | severity | file | claim |
|----|--------|----------|------|-------|
| F7 | open | IMPORTANT | browser_ext/dart/src/agent_host.dart | ⚠️ important opensession never re scopes the durable notice backlog — receipts leak across sessions the s2 fix makes receipts session scoped — newsession enforces it dart agent host dart 681 684 receipts are session scoped a fresh transcript starts with a clean notice backlog gh 2059 s2 noticebacklog clear persistnotices …but opensession — which swaps in another session s transcript — does not clear or reload the backlog and the backlog is a single host root file compactionnoticebacklog storagepath fa compaction notices json not per session dart agent host dart 694 716 — opensession restores the transcript but never touches noticebacklog agent state messages await session buildcontextmessages unawaited refresharchives emitstatus consequences 1 session a runs compact → receipts persist user opens archived session b → transcriptreplay appends noticebacklog lines → session a s compaction receipts render inside session b s chat on the next attach 2 receipts emitted under b now mix with a s leftovers in the same file and survive an sw restart into yet another session — the exact wrong context replay the backlog was built to avoid 3 newsession → opensession a → newsession shows the same staleness on the archive path this is a correctness gap in the new durability feature and it breaks the contract the fix itself documents fix is one line at the same point where the transcript is swapped dart noticebacklog clear persistnotices or scope the storage path per session id if cross session receipts are ever wanted a ut mirroring the clear empties the backlog the session scoped contract test via opensession would pin it |
| F8 | open | SUGGESTION | browser_ext/dart/lib/src/host_compaction.dart | 💡 suggestion a zero pass compact on a still over window transcript says nothing to compact instead of warning about the over window state compact gates the exhaustion notice on passes 0 dart if cancelled hooks failure null after trigger passes 0 exhausted true … notice extcompactionexhaustednotice so when the forced run makes no pass everything already summarized hidden and the measured context is still at over the trigger manualcompact falls into dart notice nothing to compact — every message is already summarized or the transcript is at its smallest the user is told nothing is wrong yet the arch 6 terminal condition still at over the window — the next request may be refused holds the extcompactionexhaustednotice guidance start a fresh session if the endpoint keeps refusing is exactly what this user needs and never sees the ac3 property test passes only because nothing to compact counts as a visible notice — it is not the over window notice cheap fix in manualcompact when after trigger and no receipt fired append the over window warning or widen the exhaustion condition to passes 0 for the manual path — the ladder already re fired visibly in the logs at that point |
| F9 | open | SUGGESTION | flutter_app/lib/services/relay_agent_service.dart | 💡 suggestion downgraded from ⚠️ per the gh 1351 protocol — justification recorded the ac2 panel e2e leg remains open — needs the tracked follow up issue round 1 raised this ⚠️ the ac2 verification chain ends at the panel render and this pr ships the sw ut half the relay agent service render ut but no browser ext e2e playwright spec for the end to end compact receipt the rework lap filed a written justification in its census gh 1351 downgrade protocol this lane cannot drive the real chrome harness no built extension or chrome runtime a spec it cannot execute would be unverifiable both ut halves ship and ci manual owns the e2e leg on that justification this round classifies the gap 💡 — it no longer gates the merge what keeps it on the books the ac2 e2e coverage exists only as a promise until the follow up lands please file the owner acked follow up issue now the rework reply already offered to — browser ext e2e compact receipt renders as a system row end to end gh 2059 ac2 — and reference it from the pr description so the deferred leg is tracked rather than forgotten precedent to copy journey sessions spec ts driven by browser ext yml on real chrome |

### How to answer

Add a `findingReview` block to `outputs/pr_review.json` (alongside `inlineComments`):

```json
{"findingReview": {
  "dispositions": [
    {"n": 1, "status": "fixed", "hunk": "<file:lines \u2014 the fixing hunk>"},
    {"n": 2, "status": "withdrawn", "reason": "<why this is not a defect>"},
    {"n": 3, "status": "re-introduced"}
  ],
  "confirmations": [
    {"proposedFor": 1, "same": true}
  ]
}}
```

Unconfirmed candidates become new identities (the merge bias is confirm-only); a genuinely new finding on a resolved item is expected to be raised again with new evidence.

